{"4073120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MISTWATER", "steam_appid": 4073120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MISTWATER</strong> is a challenge for people with Thalassophobia. Can you find salvation in the vast, terrifying ocean? It's just you, the ocean, and an old, rusty boat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a wild party on the beach, you fall asleep in an old boat tied to the shore. In the morning, you realize you're far from home and everything around you is shrouded in fog. What is this place? How did you get here? This is where your journey begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator with survival elements. Collect resources, monitor your stats, repair and upgrade your boat. All this is necessary to explore new lands in search of your home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underwater world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boat upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MISTWATER</strong> is a challenge for people with Thalassophobia. Can you find salvation in the vast, terrifying ocean? It's just you, the ocean, and an old, rusty boat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a wild party on the beach, you fall asleep in an old boat tied to the shore. In the morning, you realize you're far from home and everything around you is shrouded in fog. What is this place? How did you get here? This is where your journey begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator with survival elements. Collect resources, monitor your stats, repair and upgrade your boat. All this is necessary to explore new lands in search of your home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underwater world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boat upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "MISTWATER is a challenge for people with Thalassophobia. Can you find salvation in the vast, terrifying ocean? It's just you, the ocean, and an old, rusty boat.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073120/b5ed4f78171666f09290b335ed89e1bdd89c0f8a/header.jpg?t=1784627884", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073120/7b1f3eee5ac1c0b0d94aef87ed42a9928bacd038/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784627884", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073120/7b1f3eee5ac1c0b0d94aef87ed42a9928bacd038/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784627884", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10/11 64 Bit;<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core 2,5 GHz+;<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GEFORCE RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10/11 64 Bit;<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core 2,5 GHz+;<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GEFORCE RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements":